stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: engine fires,<br/>Intervention created
    Active --> Faded: sentence edited<br/>or underline loses match
    Active --> Resolved: user engages<br/>(answer / apply scaffold / accept verdict)
    Active --> Ignored: cooldown passes,<br/>no user action
    Faded --> Active: sentence re-completed<br/>re-trigger
    Faded --> Resolved: user re-engages
    Ignored --> [*]: stays in audit log<br/>status=ignored
    Resolved --> [*]: status=resolved<br/>resolvedAt set

    note right of Active
        userAction = null initially
        visible as wavy underline
    end note
